  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_9752.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Hasta este domingo, 1 de febrero, puede verse en la cafeteria Druida, de la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45, en Onda, la exposici&oacute;n de fotos de Clara Aguilella &#39;Nit Dia&#39;, en la que retrata la contaminaci&oacute;n luminica en Valencia.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9744.jpg\" alt=\"img_9744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9745.jpg\" alt=\"img_9745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9746.jpg\" alt=\"img_9746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9748.jpg\" alt=\"img_9748\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9750.jpg\" alt=\"img_9750\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9752.jpg\" alt=\"img_9752\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9753.jpg\" alt=\"img_9753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9755.jpg\" alt=\"img_9755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expodianitfotosclaraaguilella/img_9756.jpg\" alt=\"img_9756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"ht